% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 3.

the events are:
    the contract delivery with reason starts on day *a day*; known as contract_delivery_with_reason_starts.
    *a party* does deliver goods on day *a day*; known as does_deliver_goods.
    something happens on day *a day*; known as something_happens_on_day.
    *a party* does something on day *a day*; known as does_something_on_day.
    the clock reaches day *a day*; known as the_clock_reaches_day.
    the contract delivery full form starts on day *a day*; known as contract_delivery_full_form_starts.
    the contract no smoking policy starts on day *a day*; known as contract_no_smoking_policy_starts.
    *a party* does smoke on day *a day*; known as does_smoke.
    the contract rental agreement starts on day *a day*; known as contract_rental_agreement_starts.
    *a party* does pay rent with amount *an amount* on day *a day*; known as does_pay_rent.
    *a party* does maintain property on day *a day*; known as does_maintain_property.

the fluents are:
    delivery with reason obliges *a party* to deliver goods by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_delivery_with_reason_1.
    delivery full form obliges *a party* to deliver goods by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_delivery_full_form_1.
    no smoking policy forbids *a party* to smoke as its first obligation; known as o_no_smoking_policy_1.
    rental agreement obliges *a party* to pay rent with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_rental_agreement_1.
    the contract is fulfilled; known as the_contract_is_fulfilled.
    the contract is breached because *a reason*; known as the_contract_is_breached_because.
    the contract is breached by *a party* because *a reason*; known as the_contract_is_breached_by_because.
    rental agreement obliges *a party* to maintain property by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_rental_agreement_2.

the knowledge base because_example includes:

the text of "the L4 source because-example.l4" is at "sources/because-example.l4".

something happens on day a day from a time to a second time if
    the clock reaches day the day from the time to the second time.

something happens on day a day from a time to a second time if
    a party does deliver goods on day the day from the time to the second time.

a party does something on day a day from a time to a second time if
    the party does deliver goods on day the day from the time to the second time.

something happens on day a day from a time to a second time if
    a party does smoke on day the day from the time to the second time.

a party does something on day a day from a time to a second time if
    the party does smoke on day the day from the time to the second time.

something happens on day a day from a time to a second time if
    a party does pay rent with amount an amount on day the day from the time to the second time.

a party does something on day a day from a time to a second time if
    the party does pay rent with amount an amount on day the day from the time to the second time.

something happens on day a day from a time to a second time if
    a party does maintain property on day the day from the time to the second time.

a party does something on day a day from a time to a second time if
    the party does maintain property on day the day from the time to the second time.

% The contract delivery with reason starts: its first obligations.
when the contract delivery with reason starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 14
then delivery with reason obliges seller to deliver goods by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract delivery full form starts: its first obligations.
when the contract delivery full form starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 14
then delivery full form obliges seller to deliver goods by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract no smoking policy starts: its first obligations.
when the contract no smoking policy starts on day a day
then no smoking policy forbids employee to smoke as its first obligation.

% The contract rental agreement starts: its first obligations.
when the contract rental agreement starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 5
then rental agreement obliges tenant to pay rent with amount 2000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of delivery with reason: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does deliver goods on day a day
    and delivery with reason obliges the party to deliver goods by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that delivery with reason obliges the party to deliver goods by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and delivery with reason obliges a party to deliver goods by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached because "delivery deadline exceeded"
    and it is not the case that delivery with reason obliges the party to deliver goods by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of delivery full form: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does deliver goods on day a day
    and delivery full form obliges the party to deliver goods by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that delivery full form obliges the party to deliver goods by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and delivery full form obliges a party to deliver goods by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by seller because "failed to deliver within contractual period"
    and it is not the case that delivery full form obliges the party to deliver goods by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of no smoking policy: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does smoke on day a day
    and no smoking policy forbids the party to smoke as its first obligation
then the contract is breached by employee because "violated workplace no-smoking policy"
    and it is not the case that no smoking policy forbids the party to smoke as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of rental agreement: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does pay rent with amount an amount on day a day
    and rental agreement obliges the party to pay rent with amount the amount by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
    and a second due day = day + 30
then rental agreement obliges landlord to maintain property by day the second due day as its second obligation
    and it is not the case that rental agreement obliges the party to pay rent with amount the amount by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and rental agreement obliges a party to pay rent with amount an amount by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by tenant because "rent payment overdue"
    and it is not the case that rental agreement obliges the party to pay rent with amount the amount by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The second obligation of rental agreement: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does maintain property on day a day
    and rental agreement obliges the party to maintain property by day a due day as its second obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that rental agreement obliges the party to maintain property by day the due day as its second obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and rental agreement obliges a party to maintain property by day a due day as its second obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by landlord because "failed to perform maintenance duties"
    and it is not the case that rental agreement obliges the party to maintain property by day the due day as its second obligation.

